        "question": "<h3>1. Is the income for the household (applicant and co-applicant) from the following sources only and captured in the loan application form?</h3><ul style=\"list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0;\"><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Business / Self-employed / Agri</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Salary</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Daily wage earner</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Rental Income</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Pension Income</li></ul>"
