        "id": "4",
        "question": "<h3>4. The applicant or co-applicant are not engaged in any high-risk business, i.e.:</h3><ul style=\"list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.25rem; margin: 0;\"><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Arms / Weapons manufacturing</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Dealers in weapons / arms</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Dealers in Explosives</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Dealers in nuclear proliferation goods</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Dealers in high value goods such as gold jewellery (value above ₹1,00,00,000)</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Dealers in antiques</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Auction houses</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Real estate agents / brokers</li><li style=\"display: list-item;\">Crypto-asset dealers &amp; brokers</li></ul>"
